OL,3,GNEWSAScrapped rugby club funds diverted
OL,4,Ato town projects
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #2m of funding which had been
OL,7,Fearmarked for Keighley Cougars will now
OL,8,Fbe redirected to three other local
OL,9,Fprojects, officials have confirmed.
OL,11,FThe rugby club had been due to receive
OL,12,F#2.25m in Keighley Towns Fund cash to
OL,13,Frebuild the Danny Jones stand and
OL,14,Fcreate new facilities at Cougar Park,
OL,15,Fbut the funding was pulled by Bradford
OL,16,FCouncil's Reform UK-run leadership in
OL,17,Fthe summer.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
