OL,3,GNEWSAScrapped rugby club funds diverted
OL,4,Ato town projects
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has now been confirmed the money
OL,7,Fwill instead go towards regeneration
OL,8,Fwork in the town centre and two growth
OL,9,Fschemes for businesses and community
OL,10,Fgroups.
OL,12,FThe authority said the decisions on the
OL,13,Fnew beneficiaries had been made after
OL,14,Fan extensive "due diligence process"
OL,15,Fand the funds would now be
OL,16,F"reallocated".
